  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2285.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El caf&eacute; rock La Oveja Negra, en la calle Mallorca de Onda, ha vivido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado una divertida y concurrida fiesta de la cerveza &quot;a nuestra manera&quot;, en la que no han faltado regalos de Paulaner, sorpresas, la actuaci&oacute;n de Twoo For Blues y un concurso de beber con rapidez en equipo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2249.jpg\" alt=\"img_2249\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2250.jpg\" alt=\"img_2250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2251.jpg\" alt=\"img_2251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2252.jpg\" alt=\"img_2252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2253.jpg\" alt=\"img_2253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2254.jpg\" alt=\"img_2254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2255.jpg\" alt=\"img_2255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2256.jpg\" alt=\"img_2256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festacervesalaovejanegraonda/img_2258.jpg\" a